A directory argument and a file argument together give one glob view, the file summaries of both sorted by path.
== args
input/src
input/direct.md
== file input/src/a.md
---
description: A summary.
---
# a
== file input/direct.md
---
description: Direct file.
---
# direct
== stdout
glob view: input/src input/direct.md
input/direct.md (4 lines): description: "Direct file."
input/src/a.md (4 lines): description: "A summary."
== stderr
== exit 0
